@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@adminKey = replace-me
@rulesVersionId = 4

### Canonical season catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/seasons

### Latest award ranking (2025/2026 + World Cup 2026)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ranking?scope=season-2025&use_total=true

### World Cup remains independent
GET {{baseUrl}}/ranking?scope=world-cup-2026&use_total=true

### Legacy physical season remains available
GET {{baseUrl}}/ranking?season=2025&use_total=true

### Recalculate the complete award period with one rules snapshot
POST {{baseUrl}}/scoring/recalculate-award-period
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "scope_key": "season-2025",
  "rules_version_id": {{rulesVersionId}},
  "force_recalculate": true,
  "infer_achievements": true
}
